# Riccardo IPScore build pipeline: source material (templates + data + scripts),
# NOT a build artifact. Must survive the generic build/ rule above.
!7_ipscore/build/
!7_ipscore/build/**

# ...but build/dist/ inside it IS a build artifact: render.py recreates it, and its
# contents are byte-identical to the promoted live files in 7_ipscore/.
7_ipscore/build/dist/
